hadiths[14]{hadithnumber,text}:
"901","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar maweshi kisi ko zakhmi kare to us mein koi diyat nahin hai; agar koi kunwen mein gire to koi diyat nahin hai; agar koi kaan mein gire to koi diyat nahin hai; aur dafan khazane mein panchwan hissa hai.'"
"902","[AI-translation] Hasan (Rahimahullah) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Janwar ke zakhmi karne mein koi diyat nahin hai; agar koi kunwen mein gire to us mein koi diyat nahin hai; agar koi kaan ke neeche dab jae to us mein koi diyat nahin hai; aur dafan khazanon mein panchwan hissa hai.'"
"903","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya (pichli hadees ki manind)."
"904","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo kisi ke ghar mein baghair ijazat jhanke aur woh us ki aankh phod den to us mein na diyat hai na qisas.'"
"905","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo apne ghulam par kisi cheez ka ilzam lagae, jabke ghulam us ilzam se bari ho, to us par hadd qayam ki jayegi, siwae is ke ke ghulam bilkul waisa ho jaisa us ne kaha.'"
"906","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo apne ghulam par kisi cheez ka ilzam lagae jabke woh us ilzam se bari ho, to Qayamat ke din us par muqarrar saza qayam ki jayegi.'"
"907","[AI-translation] Umayyah bin Yazid Shami se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Islam mein koi nai baat nikale, us par Allah, farishton, aur tamam logon ki la'nat hai; Qayamat ke din us se koi nafl ya farz amal qabool nahin kiya jayega.' Poochha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! 'Hadas' se kya murad hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo na-haq jaan qatl kare ya qisas ke baghair badla le, ya sunnat ke baghair bid'at nikale.' Unhon ne kaha: «الْعَدْل» ka ma'na fidya hai, aur «الصَّرْف» ka ma'na tauba hai."
"908","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar tum kisi ko janwar se bura kaam (shahwat ka amal) karte dekho to us shakhs aur janwar ko qatl karo. Aur agar tum kisi ko qaum Loot ka amal karte dekho to karne wale aur jis se kiya jae donon ko qatl karo (fa'il aur maf'ool).'"
"909","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar mukatab (kitabat wala ghulam) qatl kiya jae to jis hisse ki us ne apni aazadi ke liye qeemat ada ki hai us hisse ki diyat aazad ki di jayegi, aur jis hisse mein woh ghulam hai us hisse ki diyat ghulam ki di jayegi.'"
"910","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Kaseer se Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) aur Marwan bin Hakam se isi ki manind riwayat hai."
"911","[AI-translation] Ikrimah se Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se wohi riwayat hai."
"912","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne «مُكَاتَب» ki diyat ke bare mein faisla farmaya ke agar woh qatl kiya jae to apni «مُكَاتَبَة» ka jitna hissa us ne ada kiya hai, utna woh aazad shumar hoga; aur baqi ghulam ki diyat shumar hogi."
"913","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: '«مُكَاتَب» ki diyat (agar woh qatl kiya jae) utni hogi jitni us ne «مُكَاتَبَة» ke liye ada ki hai.'"
"914","[AI-translation] Ikrimah se Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se wohi riwayat hai, lekin unhon ne use marfoo'an riwayat nahin kiya."
